{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0384_1002_p", "source_sha256": "af6d23c77176ae9fa0196171fa1927c2dd3f4392fd95c651ed1df7d24a39cfe4", "ja": "うん、バッチリだな！　ファンシーなテイストの中に、\nちょっぴりダークさもあって。すごく可愛いと思うよ。", "zh": "嗯，非常合适！梦幻可爱的风格中\n又带着一丝暗黑感。我觉得非常可爱哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0384_1003_001har", "source_sha256": "3ff78d8a9342cb520a911ede445202a69548059ef1616f17e7a955bd44bae7c8", "ja": "えへへ、よかったぁ♪\nちゃんと着こなせるか、少し心配だったんです。", "zh": "嘿嘿，太好了♪\n我还有点担心自己能不能把这身衣服穿出感觉呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0384_1004_001har", "source_sha256": "b7029fa0e994ae2eb31655014bb08c4bd9c272fcad3941a543fa5e8a271d8814", "ja": "よーし、それじゃあ後は……。\nはい、どうぞ♪", "zh": "好——那么接下来就是……  \n来，给你♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0384_1009", "source_sha256": "72581708f4a5c9f944f2121956fbfb746fd61b265cb305e76f64a4a968f4a7f8", "ja": "受け取る", "zh": "收下", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0384_1005_p", "source_sha256": "b125d4d6c1a24455e1cd3c0115eb60190cb5f35955958711466723d4092cac31", "ja": "ん、これはクッキー？　食べていいのか？\n……あっ、お願いっていうのは、この味見のことかな。", "zh": "嗯，这是饼干？可以吃吗？\n……啊，你说的请求，是指试吃这个吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0384_1006_001har", "source_sha256": "3f13e78b6d31fe8d657ad458131e15e6ee96c383768cdb247a7a6892e22eeecb", "ja": "そうなんです。実は、ちょっと試したいことがあって。\nふふっ、ぱくっと一口で食べてみてください♪", "zh": "没错。其实，我有件事想稍微试一下。\n呵呵，请一口把它吃掉试试看♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0384_1007_p", "source_sha256": "60d4fa0836a625e211089b7b032d8608ea0d48e39a15f9707d064f60175a106b", "ja": "ありがとう。それじゃあひとつ。\nこの色はチョコクッキーかな。どれどれ……。", "zh": "谢谢。那我就拿一个。\n这个颜色是巧克力曲奇吧。我来看看……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0384_1008", "source_sha256": "ec13ed7070459ba4617e91dc7164864ca54cffb3a2a5b5ad35f2c7ba686269b2", "ja": "ぱくっと！", "zh": "一口吃掉！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0384_2000_p", "source_sha256": "4bb72f719edf9c59134124167ba7e23a0679153035e86bbc6b0858c38aa48d3c", "ja": "んんっ、しょっぱい！？　これ塩クッキーだったのか？\nいや、それにしてもしょっぱいな……。", "zh": "唔，好咸！？这难道是咸曲奇吗？\n不对，就算这样也太咸了吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0384_2001_001har", "source_sha256": "f0b05b72d7c9314dbee3cf22ebe729ea4154933ca8f427828865ef37e488d4db", "ja": "わわわっ。ご、ごめんなさい！　\nそれ、イタズラなんです……。", "zh": "哇哇哇！对、对不起！\n那个是恶作剧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0384_2002_p", "source_sha256": "b5265737dfe3db91a0934d9e098f5a037b8b22c3a8533c2aad5018df67a017d2", "ja": "えっ？　イタズラっていうのは……。", "zh": "咦？你说的恶作剧是指……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0384_2003_001har", "source_sha256": "dcda4ee94eddb1a4a8c492e5b1cfad3f91f2752b33524485e4ed4ee66f687638", "ja": "えっと、ほら、私が演じる『雨の天使』って、\n『おひさまの天使』にイタズラするじゃないですか。", "zh": "呃，你看，就是我饰演的《雨之天使》会捉弄《阳光天使》，对吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0384_2004_001har", "source_sha256": "b059e0c03fdea77bc074d849dfcf712463f9a3f2569164614267d40bf2e0d00c", "ja": "そういうの、あまりしたことないので、\n練習してみようかなって……思って……。", "zh": "这种事我以前没怎么做过，所以……想着要不要练习一下……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0384_2005_p", "source_sha256": "c38b33474235fd278f7fdfbf001606262a7d1faaf1a13bc58a85d1768d88a512", "ja": "はは、なるほど。そういうことなら、大成功だぞ。\nすっかりひっかかってしまったからな。", "zh": "哈哈，原来如此。既然是这样，那就大成功了。\n因为我完全上当了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0384_2006_001har", "source_sha256": "ef74653745e89869df6788cbd29e188b4748bc2cc295562e45f4d03ad695762a", "ja": "ごめんなさい！　しっかり役を演じるためには、\nどんな気持ちかわかっていないとダメだと思って……。", "zh": "对不起！我觉得要把角色演好，就必须真正理解那种心情……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0384_2007_p", "source_sha256": "3e6b48504ae2d7c1cf89c96b5faa25c8287786168f8f59dfe71aa98637f4d058", "ja": "いやいや、全然構わないよ。春香が、しっかり仕事に\n向き合っているのは伝わったから。その調子で頑張れ！", "zh": "不不，完全没关系。我能感受到春香是在认真面对工作的。就照这个劲头继续努力吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0384_2008_001har", "source_sha256": "de3b4462e95950482d023c9b99a2eeecdc40e7f69fedac5c12b3bb6cbafdf67c", "ja": "はい！　……そうだ、口直しに、これをどうぞ！\n今度は、ちゃんと甘いクッキーですよ♪", "zh": "好的！……对了，这个给你，换换口味吧！\n这次是货真价实的甜饼干哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0384_2009_001har", "source_sha256": "d061600d09ece3afc20be1ba10e3b1e70016363f6cd7b9ee55c6ff0c914e94ff", "ja": "う、ウソじゃありませんからっ。\n本当に、私の自信作です！", "zh": "没、没有骗人啦。\n这真的是我的得意之作！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0384_2010_p", "source_sha256": "30bea3f3d492c6d14ac7666219459b4160ac1ab217c209cf015d26e0b8899d84", "ja": "はは、ありがとう。しょっぱいもののあとは、\n甘いものが欲しくなるからな。……うん、美味しい！", "zh": "哈哈，谢谢。吃过咸的东西之后，\n就会想吃甜的……嗯，好吃！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0384_2011_001har", "source_sha256": "3d52c828afffe39184a0fe29929c7e01320fa922c78b46acc2b2c5fc94262183", "ja": "えへへ、喜んでもらえてよかったです！　イタズラは\nするけど、本当に相手を困らせたいわけじゃない……。", "zh": "嘿嘿，你能喜欢真是太好了！虽然会恶作剧，但并不是真的想让对方为难……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0384_2012_001har", "source_sha256": "2805512af8ad9be48142961100f4729e61a0883e15b3936347a016569d5a615f", "ja": "『雨の天使』の気持ちが、少しわかった気がします！\n……ちょっとクセになっちゃうかも。ふふっ♪", "zh": "我好像稍微明白了《雨之天使》的心情！\n……说不定会有点上瘾呢。呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
